  charlesmcclintockwilson.com All rights reserved.

  September 10, 2025, Orem, Utah, USA: Attendees flee the scene moments after
  conservative

  activist Charlie Kirk is shot during a public event at Utah Valley University.
  The shooting occurs

  during a Q&A session with students, approximately two minutes into the
  exchange. Kirk appears

  to be struck in the neck. The campus is evacuated as emergency protocols are
  activated. A

  university spokesperson states that no suspect is in custody at the time,
  though an earlier campus

  alert indicated that police had detained an individual. (Credit Image: ©
  Charles-McClintock

  Wilson/ZUMA Press Wire)

  "OCCUPANCY

  U.S.ARMY
